Design a one-shot signal generator that converts a 4-bit edge signal into a level signal. The module captures rising edges of the input signals and outputs a one-cycle pulse for each detected edge, producing a 4-bit level signal that is high only for one clock cycle corresponding to active edges in the input signal.
