Design a 8-to-1 multiplexer that selects one of eight 16-bit input lines (in0 to in7) based on a 3-bit selection signal (sel). The output (o) reflects the chosen input, with output determined by which combination of the selection bits is high, effectively routing the corresponding input to the output while all other inputs remain masked.
